Modifications and scope:
    Adapted modules are repackaged for a standalone AIPHARMA inference service.
    In addition to changed import paths, a comparison against REINVENT4
    upstream commit 0f075b349ed22015e0406350c6f426701bb0815d found
    changes involving SMILES randomization/isomeric handling, RNN device
    placement, tensor allocation, model tokenizer wiring, and removal of
    metadata utility methods. These are not just cosmetic import changes.
    vocabulary.py and model_mode_enum.py matched that pinned upstream
    version after excluding local attribution headers; six others differed.
    Exact original upstream revision used for adaptation has not been
    proven. Functional equivalence to a current upstream release is NOT
    claimed. See reproducibility/REINVENT_UPSTREAM_DIFF_20261114.md.
